{"n": 675, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "675.webp", "text": "34-31\n\n6112510 REMOVING ANDO INSTALLING/\nREPLACING ONE FRONT PULSE\n(SPEED) SENSOR FOR ABS\n\nTurn off ignition,\nUnscrew socket head screw.\n\nPull out pulse sensor.\n\nInstallation:\n\nCheck pulse sensor for damage, replacing it\nnecessary.\n\nLubricate pulse sensor and housing with\nMolykote Longterm 2 before installing.\nSpacing is given for pulse sensors by the\ntake-up bores.\n\nWhen replacing pulse sensor,\n\ndisconnect plug in engine compartment and\npush wires through downward.\n\nLift wires out of holders.\n\nCheck operation of ABS — 34 50 000.\n\nRemoving and Installing/Replacing Front Pulse\nWheel for ABS:\n\nThe front pulse wheel can only be replaced\ntogether with the bearing assembly.\n\nSee “Replacing Wheel Hub — 31 21 180\"\n\n6112522 HEMOVING AND INSTALLING!\nREPLACING ONE REA PULSE\n(SPEED) SENSOR FORK AGS\n\nTurn off ignition\n\nRemove rear wheel 36 10 300\n\nUnscrew socket head scrow\n\nInstallation\n\nThe distance* between pulse sensor and pulse\nwheel (A) is given by design and cannot be\nadjusted,\n\nHowever, it is necessary to visually impect\npulse wheel for dirt or damage\n\nLift wires out of holders\n\nPull out pulse sensor\n\nInstallation\n\nCheck pulse sensor for damage, replacing if\nnecessary\n\nLubricate pulse sensor and housing with\nMolykote Longterm 2.\n\nWhen replacing pulse sensor,\nremove rear seat 52 20 010.\nDisconnect plug for pulse sensor\nPull out rubber grommet and wires\nDisconnect pulse sensor\nImportant!\n\nDon’t damage rubber grommet.-\n\nRemoving and Installing/Replacing Rear Pulse\nWheel for ABS:\n\nThe rear pulse wheel can only be replaced\ntogether with the rear output shaft.\n\nSee “Removing and Installing Output Shaft\n33 21 000\".\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["34-31", 0.4661, 0.0245, 0.5299, 0.0491], ["6112510", 0.2649, 0.0617, 0.3141, 0.0723], ["REMOVING", 0.3278, 0.0623, 0.387, 0.0729], ["ANDO", 0.3911, 0.0623, 0.4149, 0.0729], ["INSTALLIN